  "text": "### Opening Process  \n**Steps:**\n1. Customer visits website, branch, or calls\n2. Chooses product (SmartSaver)\n3. Provides ID and address proof (KYC)\n4. AML screening\n5. Risk assessment\n6. Account created\n7. Customer activates online login\n8. First deposit made  \n**Timeline:**\n- Online: 1–2 business days\n- Branch: Same day or next day\n- Postal: 5–7 business days  \n---",
